These filter types are strictly ordered -- therefore, they support the following matchers:
- Equals
- Less Than / Less Than or Equal To
- Greater Than / Greater Than or Equal To

<table style="width:100%">
  <tr>
    <th>Matcher</th>
    <th>Details</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <th>$eq</th>
    <th>

  Equals

    {
      "ageRange.maxValue": {
