  </tr>
  <tr>
    <th>$le</th>
    <th>

  Less than or equal to

    {
      "ageRange.maxValue": {
        "$le": "40"
      }
    }

  </tr>
  <tr>
    <th>$ge</th>
    <th>

  Greater than or equal to

    {
      "time.end": {
        "$ge":  "2018-08-28T05:56"
      }
    }

  </tr>
  <tr>
    <th>Combinations</th>
    <th>

  While we do not support "between" in our filtering syntax, it is possible to combine multiple matchers for a result similar to an "and" operation:

    {
      "ageRange.maxValue : {
